  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve access of Roma communities to social, health and other rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote access to social and health rights of Roma in Ukraine by improving access to services, ID registration and information, mobilize Roma communities through the work of the network of the Roma mediators and  strengthen the dialog with the regional/local authorities; to empower Roma communities in Ukraine to effectively participate in  policy processes, affecting their development and human rights</narrative>
  </description>
